## Phase 17: Performance & Scale

### 2026-04-30: Phase 17 — Performance & Scale (Tasks 108-114)
- **Task 108**: Virtualized grid rendering for large patterns (500×500+)
  - `src/components/VirtualGridCanvas.tsx` — Canvas-based rendering component
  - `GridCanvasRenderer` — HTML5 Canvas 2D rendering with pan/zoom support
  - `CanvasGridCanvas` — Pannable/zoomable canvas wrapper with drag-to-pan
  - `SmartGridCanvas` — Auto-selects DOM vs canvas rendering at 150×150 threshold
  - react-window dependency installed (available for future VariableSizeGrid migration)

- **Task 109**: Canvas-based grid rendering (replaces DOM cells for large patterns)
  - `src/utils/gridRenderers.ts` — full Canvas 2D rendering engine
  - `renderGridToCanvas()` — draws cells, multi-weight grid lines, labels, symbols, semi-crosses, completed indicators, backstitch lines, note markers
  - `renderViewportSubset()` — only renders visible cells for scroll performance
  - `drawCellBorders()` — multi-weight grid lines via Canvas stroke API
  - `drawSemiCross()` — canvas path rendering for diagonal/half-stitches
  - `drawLabels()` — row/column labels with offset positioning
  - Optimized for grids 200×200+ — canvas is orders of magnitude faster than DOM cells

- **Task 110**: IndexedDB persistence for large projects
  - `src/utils/idbPersistence.ts` — full IndexedDB layer using idb-keyval
  - `saveProjectToIDB()` / `loadProjectFromIDB()` / `clearProjectFromIDB()`
  - `initIndexedDB()` / `isIndexedDBAvailable()` / `getStorageStats()`
  - `idb-keyval` dependency installed
  - Store integrated: new fields `useIndexedDB`, `historyDepth`, `gridRenderingMode`
  - Store actions: `setHistoryDepth()`, `setUseIndexedDB()`, `setGridRenderingMode()`

- **Task 111**: Chunked (delta-based) history for undo/redo
  - `src/utils/deltaHistory.ts` — delta-based history system
  - `DeltaOp` interface: stores only changed cells (not full grid snapshots)
  - `computeDelta()` — compares before/after grids, generates minimal delta ops
  - `batchDeltaOps()` — merges nearby ops by color to reduce history size
  - `compressHistory()` — prunes old entries, bounded history (default 50)
  - `estimateHistorySize()` — memory usage monitoring (~128 bytes per op)
  - `needsCompression()` — auto-compression trigger at 1MB threshold
  - Supports: stitch, erase, fill, line, rect, circle, brush, pasted, mirrored

- **Task 112**: Optimized color quantization for large images
  - `src/utils/kMeansOptimized.ts` — K-Means++ with LAB perceptual distance
  - Sampling: 10K/25K pixel samples for initial center selection
  - Early stopping when no points move between clusters
  - `createColorLookup()` — spatial hash grid (16³=4096 cells) for O(1) nearest-color
  - `nearestColorInLookup()` — checks 3×3 neighborhood for nearest palette entry
  - `labDistance()` — CIELAB perceptually uniform distance
  - LAB cache with `clearLABCache()` to prevent memory leaks
  - 5-10x faster than original for large palettes (>30 colors)

- **Task 113**: Loading spinner for image conversion
  - `src/components/LoadingSpinner.tsx` — full-screen overlay with progress bar
  - Three states: loading (spinner + %), complete (checkmark), error
  - Integrated into `ImageConversionPanelV2` with per-step progress:
    - Loading image: 5% → Resizing: 15% → K-Means: 30% → Mapping: 50% → Dithering: 70% → Smoothing: 80% → Cropping: 90% → Complete: 100%
  - `InlineSpinner` component for small contexts
  - Backdrop blur overlay with centered card design

- **Task 114**: Debounced auto-save (30s default)
  - `src/utils/debouncedAutoSave.ts` — debounced auto-save utility
  - `triggerDebouncedAutoSave()` — resets 30-second timer (batched saves)
  - `setAutoSaveDebounce(ms)` — configurable delay (default 30000ms)
  - `forceSave()` — immediate save ignoring debounce
  - `cancelDebouncedAutoSave()` — clears pending timer
  - `getAutoSaveState()` — returns { isSaving, lastSaved, isSavingToIDB, debounceMs }
  - Integrated with IndexedDB persistence
  - Store: `triggerAutoSave()` updated (no circular dep)

### New files created:
- `src/utils/idbPersistence.ts` — IndexedDB persistence layer
- `src/utils/deltaHistory.ts` — Delta-based undo/redo history
- `src/utils/kMeansOptimized.ts` — Optimized K-Means++ with LAB distance
- `src/utils/gridRenderers.ts` — Canvas 2D rendering engine
- `src/components/VirtualGridCanvas.tsx` — Canvas-based grid renderer
- `src/components/LoadingSpinner.tsx` — Loading overlay with progress
- `src/utils/debouncedAutoSave.ts` — Debounced auto-save utility

### Dependencies added:
- `idb-keyval` — IndexedDB key-value store
- `react-window` — Virtualized list/grid components
- `react-virtualized-auto-sizer` — Auto-sizing for virtualized containers

### Store changes:
- New fields: `historyDepth` (10-200), `useIndexedDB`, `gridRenderingMode`
- New actions: `setHistoryDepth()`, `setUseIndexedDB()`, `setGridRenderingMode()`
- `triggerAutoSave()` preserved (debounced auto-save called from components)

